    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="13.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 13.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þæt dóm stande þar þegenas sámmǽle beon; gif hig sacan, stande þæt hig VIII secgað; ⁊ þa þe ðær oferdrífene beoð, gilde heora ælc VI healfmarc.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And a verdict in which the thegns are unanimous shall be held valid; if they disagree, the verdict of eight of them shall be valid, and those who are outvoted in such a case shall each pay 6 half-marks.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et iudicium stet, ubi taini consenserint; si dissideant, stet quod ipsi octo dicent; et qui superuicti erunt ex eis, reddat unusquisque sex dimidiam marcam.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
